  <p style="text-indent:24.75pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span>If securities are registered pursuant to Section 12(b) of the Act, indicate by check mark whether the financial statements of the registrant included in the filing reflect the correction of an error to previously issued financial statements. <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20231025130747266" name="dei:DocumentFinStmtErrorCorrectionFlag" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" format="ixt:fixed-false">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></p>
