  <p style="text-indent:24.75pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span>Indicate by check mark whether the registrant is a shell company (as defined in Rule 12b-2 of the Act). Yes <ix:nonNumeric id="F20231025072913937_26" name="dei:EntityShellCompany" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" format="ixt:fixed-false">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric>&#160; &#160; No &#9746;</span></span></span></p>
  <p style="text-indent:24.75pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span>As of June 30, 2025, the last business day of the registrant's most recently completed second quarter, the aggregate market value of the registrant's common stock held by non-affiliates of the registrant was approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="F20231025072913937_27" name="dei:EntityPublicFloat" contextRef="C_20250630" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">11.2</ix:nonFraction> million based on the closing price as reported on the Nasdaq Capital Market on that date. For purposes of determining this number, all named executive officers and directors of the registrant as of June 30, 2025 were considered affiliates of the registrant. This number is provided only for the purposes of this Annual Report on Form 10-K, and does not represent an admission by either the registrant or any such person as to the affiliate status of such person.</span></span></span></p>
  <p style="text-indent:24.75pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span>As of February 23, 2026, the registrant had <ix:nonFraction id="F20231025072913937_28" name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" contextRef="C_20260223" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2,430,808</ix:nonFraction> shares of its common stock, no par value ("Common Shares") outstanding.</span></span></span></p>
