      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><i>The following Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations ("MD&amp;A") of the Company should be read in conjunction with the Company's audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended December 31, 2025, and the accompanying notes thereto (the "Financial Statements") included in this Annual Report, which have been prepared in accordance with U.S. GAAP. Amounts are expressed in United States dollars ("$" or "USD") unless otherwise stated to be in Euro ("&#8364;"). Amounts stated in foreign currencies include approximate USD amounts based on exchange rates on December 31, 2025. Variance, ratio, and percentage changes in this MD&amp;A are based on unrounded numbers. This MD&amp;A reports the Company's activities through December 31, 2025, unless otherwise indicated. All share-related information presented in this section gives effect to the Share Consolidation.</i></span></span></p>
