      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span>Depreciation expense for the year ended December 31, 2025 was less than $<ix:nonFraction id="F20231019113055546_11" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million (2024 - less than $<ix:nonFraction id="F20231019113055546_12" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="C_20240101to20241231" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million) and was recorded in depreciation and amortization in the consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive loss.</span></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">For the year ended December 31, 2024, the Company recorded an impairment charge of the remaining value of the property, plant and equipment of ACA Mueller ADAG Pharma Vertriebs GmbH, within the commercial and wholesale segment. The amount of less than $<ix:nonFraction id="F20231019113055546_13" name="us-gaap:TangibleAssetImpairmentCharges" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million (2025 - $<ix:nonFraction id="F20231019113055546_14" name="us-gaap:TangibleAssetImpairmentCharges" contextRef="C_20240101to20241231" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-6" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">nil</ix:nonFraction>) is included in "other asset impairments" in the consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive loss.</span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">As at December 31, 2025, the Company's property, plant and equipment have no significant restrictions on title or pledges as security for liabilities, there are no significant commitments for future purchases, and there were no significant disposals during the year ended December 31, 2025.</span></span></p>
