      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span>United was founded in 2024 and is a distributor of cannabis-infused drinks. The acquisition allowed the Company to drive synergies with its existing portfolio of brands.</span></span></span></span></p>
