      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span>As discussed in Note 2 and Note 5, the Company transferred <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260217175250417" name="zstk:SubsidiaryEquityInterestsTransferredPercentage" contextRef="C_20250204_usgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis_zstkAssetAcquisitionOfTruhcPharmaGmbhTruhcMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the issued and outstanding equity interests of TruHC and other entities to Flora Growth US Holdings LLC and certain Noteholders of the Company in exchange for full satisfaction of the balance receivable under the promissory notes issued by the Company to such Noteholders as part of the Company's acquisition of United Beverage Distribution Inc. on February 4, 2025.</span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span><i>AV business combination</i></span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span>On June 4, 2024, the Company acquired <ix:nonFraction id="F20250312040558888_20" name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionPercentageOfVotingInterestsAcquired" contextRef="C_20240604_usgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis_zstkAustralianVaporizersPtyLtdAvBusinessCombinationMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the issued and outstanding common shares of AV in exchange for <ix:nonFraction id="F20250312040558888_18" name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestsIssuedOrIssuableNumberOfSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20240601to20240604_usgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis_zstkAustralianVaporizersPtyLtdAvBusinessCombinationMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">14,103</ix:nonFraction> common shares of the Company, valued at $<ix:nonFraction id="F20250312040558888_19" name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestIssuedOrIssuableValueAssigned" contextRef="C_20240604_usgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis_zstkAustralianVaporizersPtyLtdAvBusinessCombinationMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.6</ix:nonFraction> million, which represents the <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20250322062934784" name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestsIssuedOrIssuableNumberOfSharesIssued" contextRef="C_20240601to20240604_usgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis_zstkAustralianVaporizersPtyLtdAvBusinessCombinationMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">14,103</ix:nonFraction> common shares issued multiplied by the $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20250322064840878" name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionSharePrice" contextRef="C_20240604_usgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis_zstkAustralianVaporizersPtyLtdAvBusinessCombinationMember" unitRef="CAD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">45.24</ix:nonFraction> share price on June 4, 2024. AV was founded in 2010 and is an online retailer of vaporizers, hardware, and accessories in Australia. The acquisition provided the Company with a historically profitable business and allowed the Company to drive synergies with its existing portfolio of brands.</span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span>The purchase is accounted for as a business combination with amounts recognized as at the acquisition date for each major class of assets acquired and liabilities assumed are as follows:</span></span></span></span></p>
