      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span>As discussed in Note 2 and Note 5, the Company transferred <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260217175305928" name="zstk:SubsidiaryEquityInterestsTransferredPercentage" contextRef="C_20240604_usgaapBusinessAcquisitionAxis_zstkAustralianVaporizersPtyLtdAvBusinessCombinationMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the issued and outstanding equity interests of AV and other entities to Flora Growth US Holdings LLC and certain Noteholders of the Company in exchange for full satisfaction of the balance receivable under the promissory notes issued by the Company to such Noteholders as part of the Company's acquisition of United Beverage Distribution Inc. on February 4, 2025.</span></span></span></span></p>
