          <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><strong>OTHER ISSUANCES</strong></span></span></p>
          <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">On March 8, 2024, the Company entered into a settlement agreement with a third party pursuant to which the Company issued <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230807154719382" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesOther" contextRef="C_20240304to20240308" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1,283</ix:nonFraction> common shares of the Company, valued at $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230807154801789" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueOther" contextRef="C_20240304to20240308" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million, to a third party to settle outstanding amounts owed.</span></span></p>
