      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span>There were no SARs exercised for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024.</span></span></span></span></p>
