      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span><strong>SEPTEMBER PRIVATE PLACEMENT</strong></span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span>As discussed in Note 16, the Company issued an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002186_53" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkSeptemberPrivatePlacementMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3,004,249</ix:nonFraction> PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants and <ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002186_54" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">105,666</ix:nonFraction> PIPE Warrants on September 26, 2025, in connection with the first closing of the PIPE Offering. The Company issued another <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260218203306010" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20251009to20251009_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkSeptemberPrivatePlacementMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,962,681</ix:nonFraction> PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants and <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260218203342652" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20251009to20251009_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1,586</ix:nonFraction> PIPE Warrants on October 9, 2025, in connection with the second closing of the PIPE Offering. Subject to shareholder approval, which occurred on December 19, 2025, each PIPE Pre-Funded Warrant entitles the holder to purchase one common share at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002190_55" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.0001</ix:nonFraction>, and each PIPE Warrant entitles the holder to purchase one common share at an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002191_56" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">25.19</ix:nonFraction>. The PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants have no expiry date, whereas the PIPE Warrants expire <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fxbrl_20260219150423713">1,825</span> days after shareholder approval.</span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">The PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants and the PIPE Warrants are classified as equity because they are freestanding financial instruments, are immediately exercisable, permit the holder to receive a fixed number of the Company's common shares and do not provide any guarantee of value or return.</span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span>Of the total PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants issued in connection with the first closing of the PIPE Offering, <ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002191_57" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2,592,212</ix:nonFraction> were exchanged for 0G Tokens and recorded at fair value of $<ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002191_58" name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetFairValue" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">54.7</ix:nonFraction> million, based on the Company's common share closing price of $<ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002192_59" name="zstk:WarrantsIssuedPricePerWarrant" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">21.10</ix:nonFraction> per share on the issuance date. Of the total PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants issued in connection with the second closing of the PIPE Offering, <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260218222607800" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriod" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="Shares" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,954,743</ix:nonFraction> were exchanged for 0G Tokens and recorded at fair value of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260218222618908" name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetFairValue" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">113.3</ix:nonFraction> million, based on the Company's common share closing price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260218222628739" name="zstk:WarrantsIssuedPricePerWarrant" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">19.02</ix:nonFraction> per share on the issuance date.</span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span><span>The remaining PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants and PIPE Warrants were issued for cash proceeds in bundled transactions that, in certain cases, also included PIPE Common Shares. For each transaction, cash proceeds were allocated among the underlying securities based on relative fair values at issuance. The fair values of the PIPE Common Shares and PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants from the first closing of the PIPE Offering reflect the Company's common share closing price of $<ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002196_60" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">21.10</ix:nonFraction> per share on that date. The fair value of the PIPE Warrants was determined using the Black-Scholes option pricing model with the following inputs: share price of $<ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002203_67" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="C_20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">21.10</ix:nonFraction>, risk-free interest rate of <ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002203_68" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3.7</ix:nonFraction>%, expected volatility of <ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002203_69" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">102.5</ix:nonFraction>%, expected term of <ix:nonNumeric id="F20260217193002204_71" name="zstk:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerms" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember">1,825 days</ix:nonNumeric>, and dividend yield of <ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002204_70" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedDividendRate" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0</ix:nonFraction>%. Of total cash proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002197_61" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">13.3</ix:nonFraction> million, $<ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002197_62" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">9.0</ix:nonFraction> million was allocated to PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants and $<ix:nonFraction id="F20260217193002197_63" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkFirstClosingMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-