ngementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerms" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember">1,825 days</ix:nonNumeric>, and dividend yield of <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260218023254850" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedDividendRate" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="Pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0</ix:nonFraction>%. Of total cash proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260218023306632" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million, $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260218023321667" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million was allocated to PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants and less than $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260218023344916" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfPrivatePlacement" contextRef="C_20250926to20250926_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkPrivatePlacementWarrantMember_zstkPipeOfferingClosingAxis_zstkSecondClosingMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million allocated to PIPE Warrants.</span></span></span></span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;text-align:justify">There were <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260224111322909" name="zstk:NumberOfWarrantsExercised" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkSeptemberPrivatePlacementMember" unitRef="Shares" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">69,520</ix:nonFraction> PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants exercised during the year ending December 31, 2025, and the total number of PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants outstanding was <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260224111333788" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding" contextRef="C_20251231_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkSeptemberPrivatePlacementMember" unitRef="Shares" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">8,897,410</ix:nonFraction> as of December 31, 2025, all of which were vested were exercisable and have no expiry date. The intrinsic value of PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants exercised was $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260224111345055" name="zstk:IntrinsicValueOfWarrantsExercised" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231_usgaapStatementEquityComponentsAxis_zstkPreFundedWarrantsMember_usgaapSubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_zstkSeptemberPrivatePlacementMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.4</ix:nonFraction> million.</p>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt">There were no warrants exercised for the year ended December 31, 2024. The total fair value of warrants and pre-funded warrants granted during the year ended December 31, 2025 was $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260224111354999" name="zstk:FairValueOfWarrantsGranted" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" unitRef="USD" scale="3" decimals="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">179.1</ix:nonFraction> million (2024 - $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260224111404885" name="zstk:FairValueOfWarrantsGranted" contextRef="C_20240101to20241231" unitRef="USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">nil</ix:nonFraction>).</p>
