        <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt">Income taxes paid, net of refunds, during the year ended December 31, 2025 were immaterial.</span></span></p>
        <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt">The Company had no unrecognized income tax benefits because of uncertain income tax positions for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024.</span></span></p>
