      </ix:exclude></div>
      <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">The Company is not subject to any external capital requirements.</span></span></p>
