        <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif">&#160;</p>
        <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif">The Company, through the September 2025 ATM, issued a total of <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260224180954586" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="C_20260101to20260223_usgaapSubsequentEventTypeAxis_usgaapSubsequentEventMember" unitRef="Shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">18,265</ix:nonFraction> common shares of the Company at an average purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260224181005564" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockPricePerShare" contextRef="C_20260223_usgaapSubsequentEventTypeAxis_usgaapSubsequentEventMember" unitRef="USD_Per_Share" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">6.29</ix:nonFraction> per share for gross proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260224181022317" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" contextRef="C_20260101to20260223_usgaapSubsequentEventTypeAxis_usgaapSubsequentEventMember" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.1</ix:nonFraction> million subsequent to December 31, 2025.&#160;<br/>&#160;</p>
