  <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><i>Director Compensation Narrative</i></span></span></p>
  <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">From the period from January 1, 2025 to September 30, 2025 each independent member of the Board received $30,000 per annum or prorated for their period of service for their services as a member of the Board. For the period from October 1, 2025 to December 31, 2025, each director received the prorated portion of an annual retainer of $80,000 plus $10,000 for chairing a committee and $5,000 for each committee membership.</span></span></p>
  <p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:10pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><i><strong>Employment and Consulting Agreements, Arrangements or Plans</strong></i></span></span></p>
