  <p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-left:36pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">&#8226;<span style="display:inline-block;width:16.7pt">&#160;</span>each of our executive officers and directors;</span></span></p>
